Description: fediverse client for people who miss Point.im and Juick
 A desktop client for GoToSocial, Mastodon, Akkoma and anything else that
 speaks the Mastodon API: whole threads as trees, every reply shows what it
 answers, lanes that never jump, everything is a config option. Also runs
 in a terminal (with python3-textual), as a GTK 4 window (fedtail --ui gtk)
 and as a page in a browser.

